 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I work from bed most days. My laptop basically lives there. Moshi, is that bad for sleep?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "block": "sleep.dlg29",
   "kind": "moshi_name",
   "name_pos": "middle",
   "addressee": "Moshi",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It can. Your brain starts linking the bed with work and alertness, which makes switching off harder.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My flat's tiny though. There's",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.41,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "sleep.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "no desk.",
   "est_sec": 0.72,
   "gap_before": 1.62,
   "block": "sleep.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Even a small corner works. A chair and a fold-down table at the kitchen counter is enough.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really? Just that?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "block": "sleep.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's about having a different spot. At night, the bed becomes just for sleep again.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.34,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg29"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, I'll try the kitchen counter tomorrow.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "block": "sleep.dlg29",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
